+# Round 18 report: correlated roundings and the boundary programme
+
+Status: IN PROGRESS. The round 18 brief and the required round 17 corrections have been read. No proof of Chowla, counterexample, or equivalence is claimed at this checkpoint.
+
+## Scope and exact target
