+
+All round 18 writes are restricted to this report and `tdense18_scratch/`. No root `.research/*.md` files will be edited, no commits or subagents will be used, and all mathematical computation runs on dirichlet through `DIRICHLET_IP=34.148.157.169 src/dirun.sh -c 4`, invoked from bash. No LaTeX.
